ate transition line items so that customer users and staff can cancel an order until it is dispatched.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-6","ASM-3"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The delivered estimate file","id":"AC-8.1","level":"manual","then":"The row descriptions state the invoice is created on dispatch, and no row includes effort for changing or reissuing an invoice after an order amendment","when":"A reviewer reads the Backend 'Invoices' row and the row mapped to 'Automated invoice creation'"}],"ears":"The estimate shall scope its invoice line items so that an invoice is created automatically when an order is dispatched and amendments before dispatch never change an invoice.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-7","ASM-2"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The delivered estimate file","id":"AC-9.1","level":"manual","then":"The row description states a daily scheduled pickup, that the file carries stock quantities only, and that a file with bad rows or unknown SKUs is rejected whole with the previous stock kept and an error logged or alerted","when":"A reviewer reads the Integrations 'ERP CSV import' row"},{"given":"The delivered estimate file","id":"AC-9.2","level":"manual","then":"The daily pickup frequency is shown as a numbered assumption","when":"A reviewer reads the assumptions list"}],"ears":"The estimate shall scope its 'ERP CSV import' and 'Import testing' line items to a daily scheduled pickup of a stock-quantity-only file that is rejected as a whole, keeping the previous stock, when it contains bad rows or unknown SKUs.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-8","ASM-5","ASM-6","ASM-7"]},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The delivered estimate file","id":"AC-10.1","level":"manual","then":"The list shows a numbered entry for each of: email-and-password sign-in with email reset link and no social or single sign-on; blocking quantities above stock with a message; one price list per company falling back to a default list price; one currency, one